One of the best RTS during the last few years.
What makes Warshift special - an ability to take control over your hero unit.
Reminded me about Savage, and I'm glad that this conception got reborn in Warshift.
The fact that the game was developed by a single person makes me feel sorry for many developer team around the globe - you guys are not able to do a♥♥♥♥♥♥with millions of dollars in your pockets.
Cons:
- No much of a story;
- Sounds and voices.
- Few minor bugs (the developer works hard to fix those considering the forums)
Pros:
- Great visuals;
- Base building;
- Units diversity (air, land, sea, space);
- Action mode;
- RPG elements;
- Price ;
- Creativity.
In the time when most of studios just make game clones of each other, Kirill did something pretty new and creative, These kind of people make the game industry develop.
Must buy for any RTS fan, or those who care about creative developers and willing to support talented people with ideas.

